   padding, which left a big void above the ad bar. :has() scopes this to the
   listing's wrapper only, so other sections keep their spacing.
   The drawer is a single line on every card now, so this only needs to clear
   that one line - the section is overflow:hidden and the bottom row has no row
   below it to expand into. */
